Now, the Adjudicating Officer/ADM has found that food item was misbranded in terms of relevant regulation under the FSS (P&L) Regulation, 2011, which read as under: "2.2.1.5. Contents on the label shall be clear, prominent, indelible and readily legible by the consumer under normal conditions of purchase and use;
2.2.1.7 License number shall be displayed on the principal display panel in the following format,
namely: fssat FSSL 10000000000000
